            <ArticleTitle>Pharmacological techniques for managing acute pain in emergency departments.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>26-35; quiz 36</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is a common reason to attend hospital but it is often inadequately managed. This article examines the physiology of pain and suggests the most effective pharmacological techniques to control it.</AbstractText>
